+## Key Design Decisions
+
+| Decision | Chosen | Alternatives Considered | Rationale |
+|----------|--------|------------------------|-----------|
+| Cache eviction policy | 2Q (two-queue: A1in for first-use, Am for promoted/reused) | LRU; Frequency-based with aging | Protects comparison sheets from eviction during long sequential scans. 2Q isolates one-time screening entries (A1in) from repeatedly accessed sheets (Am), so a screening pass cannot flush the working set. Extra bookkeeping is accepted per the tenet "Never treat a cache as the authoritative copy" — private replacement tracking stays inside the preview worker. |
